/* ============ fixes: the bar tab asks first ============ */
/* Bug #8: opening Menu > Bar used to create a full bar plan on the spot, which put bar supplies and bartenders on the budget and contract even when
   the planner was only looking. Until someone decides, the tab now asks "Does this event have a bar?" and nothing is billed. */
