  return `${hi} a friendly reminder that the linens from ${e.name || 'your event'} (${pcs.toLocaleString()} piece${pcs === 1 ? '' : 's'}) were due back ${fmtDate(e.linenBack)}. Could you let us know a good time for us to pick them up, or when you can drop them off? Please return them unwashed in their bags. Any pieces that don’t come back are billed at replacement cost. Thank you!${company.name ? '\n' + company.name : ''}${company.phone ? ' · ' + company.phone : ''}`;
